Needs a connected machine: cd scrape && node run.mjs
  Reaching webtic.it / spaziocinema.info / *.18tickets.it / ucicinemas.it needs
  a normal machine. Cloud sandboxes with an allowlist (github/npm/pypi only)
  cannot run it; run.mjs refuses to overwrite data/showtimes.json when every
  scraped cinema errored, so a dead run cannot wipe the data.

